    rcases he with rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl | rfl
    · exact h89 p hpe
    · exact h158 p hpe
    · exact h159 p hpe
    · exact h170 p hpe
    · exact h171 p hpe
  refine eqAll_sound t5 _ _ (assoc bls) hbl adv 0 advOk c h1 ?_
